flowchart TD
    A[Receive FIM alert] --> B[Confirm agent, rule, path and timestamp]
    B --> C[Review Who-data fields if present]
    C --> D{Sensitive change?}
    D -->|No| E[Document and monitor]
    D -->|Yes| F[Correlate related events by identity and time]
    F --> G{Path inside lab watch?}
    G -->|No| H[Do not use lab quarantine tool]
    G -->|Yes| I[Administrator approves manual quarantine]
    I --> J[Verify SHA256 and metadata]
    J --> K[Preserve JSONL audit]
    K --> L[Restore and verify]
